'''Dog Gods''' (犬神様, ''Inugami-sama'', '''Dog God''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

